data/archive/
data/public_html/
data/bin/*
!data/bin/user/
# Track all third-party driver/extension files weectl drops here (rtldavis,
# weewx-saratoga's ws.py/rtcr.py/etc.) so a fresh clone actually has the code
# weewx.conf's driver/service entries point at. __init__.py and extensions.py
# are stock weewx boilerplate, regenerated by `weectl station create` on
# first run, so they're excluded rather than tracked.
data/bin/user/__pycache__/
data/bin/user/installer/
data/bin/user/__init__.py
data/bin/user/extensions.py
data/examples/
data/scripts/
data/util/
data/weewx.conf
data/weewx.conf.2*
*.swp
*.log
.claude/
mosquitto/data/
